<fn-group>
  <fn id="fn1">
    <label>1</label><p>Currently, with NVIDIA HPC compilers, arrays must
    be retrieved and altered using the <monospace>get</monospace> and
    <monospace>set</monospace> methods, respectively, in the
    <monospace>readonly=.true.</monospace> mode due to a compiler bug in
    nvfortran.</p>
  </fn>
